  "description": "Han Shin-woo met Ga-hyun, a female college student, at a club where she went with her colleagues for a college graduation party.  \nTwo people who meet and date each other in a relationship that saved her in an embarrassing situation.  \nShin-woo looks young and naive, and Ga-hyun falls in love with Han Shin-woo's wonderful appearance.\n\nAnd March.  \nShinwoo will be in charge of third grade homeroom at Daehan High School, where he was appointed for the first time, Jin Ga-hyun, class president of first grade class in third grade... ...?\n\n\"Maybe. Do you have an older sister?\n\nShin-woo asked with the feeling of catching straws.\n\n\"... No.\"\n\nGahyun's voice was mixed with tears.\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=4609175)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=6872609), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/58420869), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/jaejalover), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/lover_student), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1962087876), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000050622), [Toptoon](https://toptoon.com/comic/ep_list/Between_Disciple_and_Lover)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Indonesian](https://www.webtoons.com/id/romance/minor-scandal/list?title_no=3716), [Thai](https://www.webtoons.com/th/romance/minor-scandal/list?title_no=3986), [S.Chinese](https://manga.bilibili.com/detail/mc32829), [Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0001950)",
